# The build committed under web/data is deliberate: it lets anyone open the
# front end and click through a real collision without owning a GPU. It is a
# genuine Qwen3-1.7B build (see docs/FINDINGS.md), not a fixture. Your own
# `collider build` overwrites it locally; commit it only if you mean to.
